{"id":"n14619-1-7","stage":2,"title":"마주치다 · 相碰","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14619-1-7-1","ko":"길이 굉장히 복잡한가 봐.","zh":"路上好像很拥挤。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길이","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}},{"text":"굉장히","meaning":"非常，惊人地","explanation":"굉장히：非常，惊人地","readings":[{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30882","senseId":"2","lemma":"굉장히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}},{"text":"복잡한가","meaning":"混乱，混杂，凌乱，拥挤","explanation":"복잡하다：混乱，混杂，凌乱，拥挤；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"복잡하다","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66274","senseId":"2","lemma":"복잡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"복잡한가","audio":"/audio/98911d56313b43b79a4a.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"5ffdea7285118469","term":"굉장히","zh":"非常，惊人地","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3","entryId":"30882","definition":"很了不得地。","pronunciation":["굉장히","궹장히"]},{"id":"810e6e796e934ade","term":"복잡하다","zh":"混乱，混杂，凌乱，拥挤","audio":"/audio/810e6e796e934adeb9ba.mp3","entryId":"66274","definition":"某些东西或人挤在一个地方，很杂乱。","pronunciation":["복짜파다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9aababae5de85d1e1303.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14619-1-7-2","ko":"사람들이 서로 마주치고 정말 말도 아냐.","zh":"人挤人，简直乱得不像话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"마주치고","meaning":"相碰，相撞","explanation":"마주치다：相碰，相撞；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"마주치다","audio":"/audio/fdf2b1538a4b04a70457.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14619","senseId":"1","lemma":"마주치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마주치고","audio":"/audio/2ed528ca009412edc97b.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真是的","explanation":"정말：真是的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61175","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"말도","meaning":"真是的，不像话","explanation":"말：真是的，不像话；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"9","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말도","audio":"/audio/6464a9af34c6a3e538bb.mp3"}},{"text":"아냐.","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아